AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002007> "A relationship that applies between a continuant and its outer, bounding layer.  Examples include the relationship between a multicellular organism and its integument, between an animal cell and its plasma membrane, and between a membrane bound organelle and its outer/bounding membrane.")
