AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> "x 'has starts location' y if and only if there exists some process z such that x 'starts with' z and z 'occurs in' y")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> "has start location"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002231> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002479>)
