# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002296> (results in development of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002296> "p 'results in development of' c if and only if p is a developmental process and p results in the state of c changing from its initial state as a primordium or anlage through its mature state and to its final state.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002296> "results in development of"@en)
