AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002375> "A relationship that holds between two material entities in a system of connected structures, where the branching relationship holds based on properties of the connecting network.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002375> "in branching relationship with"@en)
SubObjectPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002375> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002323>)
