AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_28017> "The most important reserve polysaccharide found in plants. It is a glucan consisting of amylose and amylopectin.")
