# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002072> (nodal myocyte)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "FMA:67101") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:tfm") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002072> "A specialized cardiac myocyte in the sinoatrial and atrioventricular nodes. The cell is slender and fusiform confined to the nodal center, circumferentially arranged around the nodal artery.")
