AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000052> "Shapes are invariant on size transformations. Shapes can be subdivided into 2D and 3D shapes, We can also make a distinction between shapes of complete self-connected objects, and shapes of parts of objects.")
