AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:add") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0070047> "An affinity inhering in an anatomical structure by virtue of the bearer exhibiting a molecular interaction for both basic and acid stains under specific pH conditions.")
